===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Chilling Reign|Porygon|116}} from the {{TCG|Chilling Reign}} expansion.
*'''Ram''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Zubat|70}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
